// 1-30: everything. all of it. one last time.
id l1-30
name 1-30 FINAL SIGNAL
tagline everything. all of it. one last time.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main pull anchor capacitor
mechanics current:14 pull:9 anchor:7 yank:1 capacitor:4 neon:3 white:2 secret:2
new -
portion 4 a secret wall 12 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 7.2 hop 5 pull ports (high, mid, ceiling, high, ceiling), 7-8-7-7 apart, over current
portion 6 drive a rail 8 long, swing a 22 gap (mid, high anchors)
portion 6.5 capacitor gate 24 tiles away
portion 6.4 hop 5 floating blocks over current (heights 11323)
portion 6 zip 3 anchors (ceiling, mid, high), 9-9 apart, over current
portion 5.6 capacitor gate 18 tiles away, a block on the way
portion 5.5 two anchors up to the top lane
portion 6.9 hop 6 floating blocks over current (heights 211233)
portion 6.6 hop 4 pull ports (ceiling, low, high, ceiling), 8-8-7 apart, over current
portion 6.7 neon/white stones WWnnn (3 wide, 4 apart) over current
portion 7.6 capacitor gate 26 tiles away, a block on the way
portion 6.9 hop 6 floating blocks over current (heights 121113)
portion 5.5 capacitor gate 20 tiles away
hardness 6.2
map
